{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國總統特朗普祝賀民主黨人勝選，但說不覺得中期選舉結果是針對他本人的打擊。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>美國總統特朗普：「恭喜民主黨人，他們做得很好，他們爭取了11年，終於等到了。但我不視此為對我的打擊，我自問我們這兩年表現極佳，冠絕總統執政史，無論是經濟上，抑或一切政績。」</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:46.014839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:48:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:53.692083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:53.692083+00:00","content_hash":"e16c9da0f2567895e3cf766601f3956e29701ad2a1a655d4c2c78d580236e03d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}